WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:16.629
Girl!" called Detective Smith.

2
00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:18.150
"Where are you going?"

3
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:20.352
"I'm going back to town!"

4
00:00:20.693 --> 00:00:21.393
yelled Roxy.

5
00:00:21.413 --> 00:00:23.815
"That's where the spaceship went!"

6
00:00:24.636 --> 00:00:26.218
Roxy flew as fast as she could.

7
00:00:32.064 --> 00:00:35.247
When she reached downtown Metro City, she saw people running.

8
00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:40.211
"Agh! Aliens are attacking!"

9
00:00:40.632 --> 00:00:41.612
shouted a tall man.

10
00:00:41.632 --> 00:00:43.634
"Run for your life!"

11
00:00:44.195 --> 00:00:44.955
someone cried.

12
00:00:44.975 --> 00:00:48.138
"Save us, Rocket Girl!"

13
00:00:48.518 --> 00:00:50.080
yelled an old woman with blue hair.

14
00:00:51.481 --> 00:00:53.162
Roxy saw lots of scared people.

15
00:00:54.163 --> 00:00:56.045
But she didn't see the spaceship anywhere.

16
00:00:56.065 --> 00:00:58.447
"Where did the spaceship go?"

17
00:00:58.827 --> 00:00:59.528
Roxy wondered.

18
00:01:00.688 --> 00:01:02.310
A large group of people ran by.

19
00:01:03.431 --> 00:01:06.213
They were all wearing Shop Well Supermarket uniforms.

20
00:01:07.835 --> 00:01:09.276
"Aha!" thought Roxy.

21
00:01:09.296 --> 00:01:12.739
"The spaceship must be at the Shop Well Supermarket."

22
00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:15.842
Roxy flew to the Shop Well Supermarket.

23
00:01:18.865 --> 00:01:20.866
And then she saw it—the spaceship.

24
00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:23.309
It had crashed into the front of the store.

25
00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:26.712
Why did the spaceship keep crashing into things?

26
00:01:28.832 --> 00:01:30.754
Two green aliens came out of the store.

27
00:01:32.195 --> 00:01:33.836
Roxy hid behind a parked truck.

28
00:01:34.937 --> 00:01:36.919
The aliens had cans of tomato soup.

29
00:01:40.101 --> 00:01:43.584
Roxy watched one alien open a small door on the side of the spaceship.

30
00:01:44.645 --> 00:01:46.546
The alien poured the soup into a hole.

31
00:01:52.391 --> 00:01:55.453
The other alien got into the spaceship and tried to start the engine.

32
00:01:56.314 --> 00:01:58.516
The spaceship lifted off the ground for a second.

33
00:01:59.692 --> 00:02:01.013
But then smoke puffed out of it.

34
00:02:02.113 --> 00:02:05.535
Boom! The spaceship crashed into a parked truck.

35
00:02:06.675 --> 00:02:08.256
"Hmm," thought Roxy.

36
00:02:08.276 --> 00:02:11.657
"Maybe the spaceship runs on food."

37
00:02:12.678 --> 00:02:15.559
Another alien came out of the store with jars of applesauce.

38
00:02:16.839 --> 00:02:19.220
It dumped the applesauce into the hole in the spaceship.

39
00:02:20.241 --> 00:02:22.322
Again the aliens tried to start up the ship.

40
00:02:23.662 --> 00:02:27.044
This time it flew for a moment, and then crashed into a mailbox.

41
00:02:29.084 --> 00:02:32.085
"The food doesn't seem to be working though," Roxy thought.

42
00:02:32.105 --> 00:02:34.225
"I wonder why."

43
00:02:35.666 --> 00:02:37.446
The aliens started talking to each other.

44
00:02:38.807 --> 00:02:40.167
One was waving its arms around.

45
00:02:41.367 --> 00:02:42.688
Another was beginning to yell.

46
00:02:42.708 --> 00:02:45.669
"Uh-oh," thought Roxy.

47
00:02:46.289 --> 00:02:47.869
"The aliens don't look happy."

48
00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:51.930
One of the aliens spotted a pizza delivery truck driving by.

49
00:02:53.831 --> 00:02:56.072
The alien pointed a small device at the truck.

50
00:02:58.764 --> 00:03:00.865
Shlurp! A stream of purple slime shot out.

51
00:03:01.946 --> 00:03:04.107
The truck's wheels instantly stuck to the road!

52
00:03:07.969 --> 00:03:08.829
Rocket Girl!"

53
00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:12.071
the driver shouted as aliens surrounded the truck.

54
00:03:12.991 --> 00:03:14.612
Roxy raced toward the aliens.

55
00:03:15.513 --> 00:03:19.575
But before she could reach them, Roxy saw one alien point the device at her.
